    <string name="ui_3538e067b3a1" formatted="false">A widget in your app theme with the full token count, tool marks, quota windows, and a seven-day chart as you make it taller. Reduce Motion also applies to the widget.</string>
    <string name="ui_33f2009999b3" formatted="false">Tap Refresh for one update, or Live for 60-second Hub updates for up to an hour while the app is closed. Tap Live again or Stop in the notification to finish. Android may delay updates while the phone sleeps. Figures and the last update time are visible on your home screen.</string>
